# 公共设置模板：复制为 _common.ps1 后通过环境变量或本文件配置个人参数（勿将真实密钥提交仓库）
$ErrorActionPreference = 'Continue'

$G    = if ($env:GCLOUD_SDK_BIN) { Join-Path $env:GCLOUD_SDK_BIN 'gcloud.ps1' } else { 'gcloud' }
$KEY  = if ($env:GCP_SSH_KEY_PATH) { $env:GCP_SSH_KEY_PATH } else { '<YOUR_GCP_SSH_KEY_PATH>' }
$ZONE = if ($env:GCP_ZONE) { $env:GCP_ZONE } else { 'us-central1-a' }
$INST = if ($env:GCP_INSTANCE) { $env:GCP_INSTANCE } else { 'orca-cpu-16' }
$PROJ = if ($env:GCP_PROJECT_ID) { $env:GCP_PROJECT_ID } else { '<YOUR_GCP_PROJECT_ID>' }

$Root = Split-Path $PSScriptRoot -Parent
$Stage3Local = (Get-ChildItem $Root -Directory -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Where-Object { $_.Name -like '*_ORCA' -or $_.Name -like 'stage3*' } | Select-Object -First 1).FullName
$LogDir = Join-Path $PSScriptRoot 'logs'
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path $LogDir | Out-Null

function Start-Log([string]$name) {
    $script:LogFile = Join-Path $LogDir ("{0}_{1}.txt" -f $name, (Get-Date -Format 'yyyyMMdd_HHmmss'))
    $script:LatestFile = Join-Path $LogDir ("latest_{0}.txt" -f $name)
    "==== $name  $(Get-Date -Format 'yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss')" | Out-File $script:LogFile -Encoding utf8
}

function Log([string]$msg) {
    Write-Output $msg
    Add-Content -Path $script:LogFile -Value $msg -Encoding utf8
}

function Close-Log {
    Copy-Item $script:LogFile $script:LatestFile -Force
    Write-Host "`n日志已保存：$script:LogFile" -ForegroundColor Green
}

function Get-Status {
    (& $G compute instances describe $INST --zone=$ZONE --project=$PROJ --format='value(status)' 2>&1 | Out-String).Trim()
}

function Ensure-Running {
    $s = Get-Status
    Log "实例状态：$s"
    if ($s -eq 'SUSPENDED') {
        Log '正在 resume ...'
        & $G compute instances resume $INST --zone=$ZONE --project=$PROJ --quiet 2>&1 | ForEach-Object { Log "$_" }
    } elseif ($s -eq 'TERMINATED') {
        Log '正在 start ...'
        & $G compute instances start $INST --zone=$ZONE --project=$PROJ --quiet 2>&1 | ForEach-Object { Log "$_" }
    }
    if ($s -ne 'RUNNING') {
        Start-Sleep -Seconds 40
        Log "现在状态：$(Get-Status)"
    }
}

# 远程命令里避免嵌套双引号（Windows PowerShell 5.1 传参容易被吞掉），优先用单引号
function Invoke-Remote([string]$cmd) {
    Log "`n>>> 远程执行：$cmd"
    & $G compute ssh $INST --zone=$ZONE --project=$PROJ "--ssh-key-file=$KEY" --quiet "--command=$cmd" 2>&1 | ForEach-Object { Log "$_" }
}
